pg-vectorsearch (0.2.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Update to upstream 0.2.0 for PostgreSQL 18 and 19.
  * Follow the upstream unversioned library name and include its SQL upgrade script.
  * Rebase RPATH and LLVM 15 compatibility patches without disabling native SIMD.
  * Upstream requires PRISM indexes to be rebuilt after upgrading from 0.1.0.

 -- Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0800

pg-vectorsearch (0.1.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep atomic function pointer initialization compatible with Clang 15.
  * Avoid LLVM 15 IFUNC thin-link failures without disabling JIT bitcode.
  * Package the upstream alpha release for PostgreSQL 18 evaluation.
  * Retain portable SIMD, OpenBLAS, DWARF, and main-package LLVM bitcode.
  * Exclude the regression helper and remove the unnecessary library RPATH.
  * Use the same source archive and RPATH patch as the RPM recipe.

 -- Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0800
